OL,3,GNEWSACommunity pub launches fundraiser
OL,4,Ato buy building
OL,5,
OL,6,FA community pub in Brighton has
OL,7,Flaunched a fundraiser to buy its
OL,8,Fbuilding, after the landlord confirmed
OL,9,Fthey now have a year to purchase the
OL,10,Fpremises for a fixed price.
OL,12,FThe Bevy pub in Moulsecoomb opened its
OL,13,Fdoors in December 2014, four years
OL,14,Fafter the old Bevendean pub closed.
OL,16,FLandlord, East Brighton Trust, intended
OL,17,Fto sell the building last month but now
OL,18,Fthe Bevy Committee has been told it has
OL,19,F12 months to raise the #500,000 needed
OL,20,Fto become outright owners.
OL,23,APub: 10-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,329,320,200,140,0,100
