OL,3,GNEWSACommunity pub launches fundraiser
OL,4,Ato buy building
OL,5,
OL,6,FCommittee chair, Warren Carter, said:
OL,7,F"We have a year to make community
OL,8,Fownership happen. No one built this
OL,9,Fplace alone, and no one needs to buy it
OL,10,Falone either."
